# A pi with one of its own selectors up, on a pane with nothing above it. This
# is not a stop a tool call raised and not a prompt: a person opened a widget,
# it is drawn where the composer was, and `send` would type into it. The agent
# is still there afterwards, the way pi is: whoever is driving this scenario
# decides when it ends.
screen boot
sleep 50
screen selector
sleep 600000
